Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 08:06:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/42] feat(amdgpu): add owner-bound generic dispatch v2
 admission

Add a bridge-facing owner-bound MAP/ALLOC/publish/SUBMIT/RETIRE/UNMAP state adapter for the generic dispatch-v2 contract. Validate committed code-object metadata, descriptor preload fail-closed behavior, queue identity, full-manifest kernarg shape, CP rejection cancellation, wire-valid responses, and admission-only lifecycle without advertising or invoking a daemon MessageType 18 route.

